<title>FINLAND: TABLE-POSTIPANKKI H1 OPERATING PROFIT FALLS 17 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-POSTIPANKKI H1 OPERATING PROFIT FALLS 17 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 383 vs 462</p>
